<title>USA: Otto-Eldred SD, Pa., $3 mln, won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Otto-Eldred SD, Pa., $3 mln, won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said it won $3.450 million of Otto-Eldred School District, Pa., general obligation bonds series A of 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.85 percent without insurance recalculation.</p>
</text>
